@@ -4,6 +4,12 @@
 
 ## Added
 
+- Support `VFIO_USER_DEVICE_GET_REGION_IO_FDS` with ioeventfd sub-regions:
+  `Client::get_region_io_fds()` requests and parses the reply in the
+  specification's layout, `Server::add_ioeventfd()` declares sub-regions and
